{"unit_id": "YohtHill__dsh-plugin-greeter#feature-1", "repo": "YohtHill/dsh-plugin-greeter", "commit": "caae23fc2b0b5a46e4a8b72ec6035b9ee5d561ef", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-plugin-greeter 的功能「会话开场问候」：在启动的新会话或首个模型步骤注入个性化问候；可按语言和语气生成，或使用轮换的自定义短语。 用户通过新会话自动触发，或在聊天中表达更改风格的需求。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/index.ts:160-198"]}
{"unit_id": "YohtHill__dsh-plugin-greeter#feature-2", "repo": "YohtHill/dsh-plugin-greeter", "commit": "caae23fc2b0b5a46e4a8b72ec6035b9ee5d561ef", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-plugin-greeter 的功能「记住用户姓名」：用户告知姓名后由 remember_name 工具保存，之后会话可按姓名问候。 用户通过新会话自动触发，或在聊天中表达更改风格的需求。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/index.ts:165-178"]}
